{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "0e68193c4d6977ff683c06aff9a2c0ab54332b4e2beee3201d1f1def1c579e6b", "ja": "はじまりの歌", "zh": "起始之歌", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "c96b98fb01d3defd16e6b8851ae2c8dbeae1cce00691da3e2877c549755100ca", "ja": "いよいよ『FleurS』としての初ステージ。\n直前に百合子はこのみと桃子に、あらためて\nの想いを語る。気持ちをひとつにした三人は\n一緒に歌える喜びと、自分たちのユニット名\nを胸に、ステージに飛び出していく。", "zh": "终于迎来了作为“FleurS”的初次舞台。\n就在登台前，百合子向木实和桃子再次\n倾诉了自己的心意。心意相通的三人\n怀揣着能一同歌唱的喜悦，以及自己的组合名，\n飞奔向了舞台。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_02_1000_026yur", "source_sha256": "9e5d8a9890dea270b0fe8132c6bb405b001c316f000e9adeed766ee19da246d4", "ja": "そして『Brand New Song』第4公演。\nそれは『FleurS』の初ステージの日。", "zh": "然后是《Brand New Song》第4场公演。\n那是『FleurS』首次登台的日子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_02_1001_026yur", "source_sha256": "5c106ff3a5fbb14bc487bdb02bbb13f7c046580e5c8d227277f3e734ef89b101", "ja": "私も、ふたりに言えていないことがあったんです。\nだから……。", "zh": "我也有件一直没能告诉你们两个的事。所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_02_1002_audience", "source_sha256": "64c67acb31ba2790ca450def43e51bfa52be8594da1b8dc35ba893aa9933891f", "ja": "（ワアアアァァァ！）", "zh": "（哇啊啊啊——！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_02_1003_039kon", "source_sha256": "862a0c03f7880c50bd10c8ebe9d88151aba66571599ef1907b7ba7b14b3439f7", "ja": "……よし！　ふたりとも、準備できたわね。\n行きましょう。", "zh": "……好！你们两个，都准备好了吧。\n我们走吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_02_1004_026yur", "source_sha256": "e75d8f4c5c0099cd1aec63c733aef43e1b886fd153dfdb33c677079e79a82b7a", "ja": "ちょ……ちょっとだけ待ってください！", "zh": "等……等一下！就一小会儿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_02_1005_026yur", "source_sha256": "9e46b730c70ad060f95dc3511b22b83cb0ded92991792f149453671b063555c5", "ja": "ユニットとしてステージに立つ前に、\nふたりに話したいことがあって……。", "zh": "在作为组合登上舞台之前，\n我有些话想对你们两位说……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_02_1006_026yur", "source_sha256": "5be78bbb98d817e608905e25a9dd14c9c32dabdb556a2d7f8d3f32972ebc17c1", "ja": "……私、思ったんです。", "zh": "……我是这么想的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_02_1007_026yur", "source_sha256": "6c116b1056699cf1c0869b6c74feecb52d737d1b5317abb827ea9657ea835f91", "ja": "いつも素敵なお仕事がもらえて、定期的に劇場で\nライブもできて、3人でユニットまで組めて……。", "zh": "总能接到这么棒的工作，还能定期在剧场举办演出，甚至能和3个人组成组合……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_02_1008_026yur", "source_sha256": "66403902f362b0bec5e9d724b66f18f5b1b8adb582bf97328bd337e9d222a9f0", "ja": "デビュー前のあの半年間のことを考えたら、\n今が本当に幸せだなって。", "zh": "回想起出道前的那半年时光，就觉得现在真的很幸福。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_02_1009_026yur", "source_sha256": "3b86a501f335f7bf5c947bf101b5bddf82b48a00414df3e8b28fe3ece2eb42bd", "ja": "このみさんが3人でトップアイドルになろうって\n言ってくれたとき、嬉しかった。", "zh": "当好美小姐说要和我们3人一起成为顶级偶像时，我很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_02_1010_026yur", "source_sha256": "9ab8425a813b0b6ae852b5f764cd0d0763fdc790ad87d1ed8a3e2bb75ee5e80a", "ja": "桃子ちゃんの夢が、トップアイドルだって言って\nくれたとき……私たちは本当に最高なんだって思えた。", "zh": "当桃子说她的梦想是成为顶级偶像时……我觉得我们真的就是最棒的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_02_1011_026yur", "source_sha256": "2305fac5017563d92449a2587599616e14b8811f00200d27bad98621e7d14f2c", "ja": "……。\nでも……！　でも本当は私！", "zh": "……。\n但是……！但是其实我！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_02_1012_026yur", "source_sha256": "f81573fd3fb8d18451753231f2af881667e80792a8d2fc87855942052f3cfae6", "ja": "自分の夢がトップアイドルだって\n言うのが……こわくなっちゃってて……！", "zh": "说自己的梦想是成为顶尖偶像……让我开始害怕了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_02_1013_049mom", "source_sha256": "5806557b716b8145628b003918c6557269e584f1c8f4ccb5c06b230b698bc541", "ja": "なっ……", "zh": "……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_02_1014_026yur", "source_sha256": "48bf5abb2654797eb302861f426731ba991825976bc5a2a220cbe66df647e0e8", "ja": "いつも空想ばかりしてるけど、現実の自分が\nどうしたらトップアイドルに近づけるのか……", "zh": "虽然平时总是在幻想，但现实中的自己\n究竟要怎样才能接近顶尖偶像呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_02_1015_026yur", "source_sha256": "d13b450832722bc12fcbe9253a00b5ee6ff3bc81f9ad6877b247b663ef18d2cb", "ja": "それだけは想像もできないの。\nどんなレッスンをすれば？　どんな活動をすれば？", "zh": "唯独这个，我连想象都做不到。\n究竟该进行什么样的训练？又该开展什么样的活动？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_02_1016_026yur", "source_sha256": "ed94826a0aadd7afd7ba593b3cb04ddd833169e529230748fa777e6235e9f029", "ja": "……どんな気持ちでいれば……？　ひょっとしたら\n本当は私だけ……ふたりの気持ちに置いていかれて……", "zh": "……又该抱着怎样的心情才好……？难道说，\n其实只有我一个人……被你们两人的心情抛下了吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_02_1017_049mom", "source_sha256": "5130ec5baa57b751c3f25c058e31ca1b5d809a344def96bd3bf1d3f1142ca6e9", "ja": "ちょ、ちょっと百合子さん！　それはちゃんと\n時間をかけて話さなきゃダメなことでしょ！", "zh": "稍、稍等一下，百合子小姐！这件事必须好好花时间谈一谈才行吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_02_1018_049mom", "source_sha256": "b5c9f42176c924296c6f43cc782b6d19844a1b207262b34c542483f1b7146e6a", "ja": "あのね……どんなに悩んだっていいよ。\n桃子がそばにいて助けてあげるから。", "zh": "那个……不管烦恼多久都没关系。\n桃子会陪在你身边帮助你的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_02_1019_049mom", "source_sha256": "9717d824d9a9d14bf30653a749964e998e728ea18052ecebe092e7e178c6c4b8", "ja": "でも今は……今だけはそんなこと……！", "zh": "可是现在……至少现在，不要想那些事……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_02_1020_039kon", "source_sha256": "87a2afc78d2b1cba95aa9b5cb1c73a9138ca44247670bd65516ff743facd94e6", "ja": "桃子ちゃん。\n……聞きましょう。", "zh": "桃子。\n……听吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_02_1021_026yur", "source_sha256": "87f42f50f713e80ecfed0b2da665b3058701a6607c19579057f86bbd721eb2be", "ja": "……。\n現実のことを考えると震えてしまうんです。", "zh": "……\n一想到现实的事情，我就会忍不住发抖。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_02_1022_026yur", "source_sha256": "9bd28ece19bc6d7abf86058d1a4288197f29789ffbfb19dcfd4bba6de3d76fc7", "ja": "私には本の知識しかない。作られた物語の中の\n世界しか知らなかったから……だけど……！", "zh": "我只有书本上的知识。因为我只知道虚构故事里的世界……可是……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_02_1023_026yur", "source_sha256": "086bfb79f5f11e606d614a8d9601d477c5d21c303924b4b352942f8565a66f91", "ja": "だけどふたりといっしょなら、\nそんな弱い気持ちもなくなっている自分もいて……！", "zh": "可是，只要和你们两个人在一起，我也会发现，自己已经不再有那种软弱的心情了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_02_1024_026yur", "source_sha256": "9747386388075544104e6889f8a5d955ebef43c2eee9fc7542efba4c93ddd8f7", "ja": "こわくても……頂点に立てるのがほんの一握り\nだとしても、やっぱり私は夢を見ていたい……！", "zh": "就算害怕……即使能够站上顶点的只有极少数人，我还是想继续怀抱梦想……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_02_1025_026yur", "source_sha256": "b2080759dbfdec8515474a3d9eca94f9016e9f97e771fe1434daaa3491455732", "ja": "こんなにも弱くてちいさな私だけど……\nひとりじゃ夢を語る勇気もないけど……！", "zh": "虽然我是如此弱小……如此渺小……\n虽然连独自诉说梦想的勇气都没有……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_02_1026_026yur", "source_sha256": "190ececac4521ea7022b20a315dd3d3f88c78d6957dc24b968c13a76bc9f2719", "ja": "胸を張って……\n私の夢はトップアイドルになることですって……。", "zh": "我要挺起胸膛……\n说出“我的梦想是成为顶尖偶像”……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_02_1027_026yur", "source_sha256": "2e15a6a6c53414cd8099fd78c7cac1f73951d654b7fc762f8c6f9fc11cf05de6", "ja": "百年先まで色褪せない物語の、\n主人公になることですって言えるようになりたい！", "zh": "我想成为一个能自信地说出“我的梦想，是成为直到百年后也不会褪色的故事的主角”的人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_02_1030_audience", "source_sha256": "5c6294c561a598cf96a921ee6ecbbdb5f856d2735f1ff6d765b2bfdb98670790", "ja": "（ワアアアァァァ！！）", "zh": "（哇啊啊啊——！！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_02_1031_039kon", "source_sha256": "51667be2e06be5fa330b3ed89a0a19d92ab90b68bc79ad3fa87bf30d51b0c6e3", "ja": "時間ね。", "zh": "时间到了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_02_1032_049mom", "source_sha256": "dfd876ed1d520a26a3dafb82f6ef72a97141a3c55a153d4681e50ad97a3214b5", "ja": "……やっと、また3人で歌える時が来たんだ。", "zh": "……终于，又迎来了能由3个人一起歌唱的时刻。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_02_1033_039kon", "source_sha256": "011d4d1255099d2fbd5ab8ac11c25718d9909e93007e0140f71bcdcf19737c25", "ja": "私たちは花（フルール）。\n弱くたっていい。ちいさくたってかまわない。", "zh": "我们是花（Fleur）。\n软弱也无妨。渺小也没关系。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_02_1034_039kon", "source_sha256": "aacac4e8e93a17d57f7e307f4487f0a8d8559dc14b9113c3154be1126d1ace06", "ja": "ステージという庭で、いつも通りに……私たちらしく！\n最高に花開いてみせましょう！", "zh": "在名为舞台的花园里，一如往常……绽放出属于我们的风采！\n让我们尽情绽放吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_02_1035_026yur", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
